{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>POLY IMPULSE</strong> is a minimalist fast-paced movement FPS where you will have to shoot colorful polyhedrons to impulse yourself through the level. Accuracy is also very important so you will put your aim to a test with this game! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Shoot neon green icosahedron to impulse yourself and gain speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805260/extras/20f0f628b1f7624ae0964b1638118182.poster.avif?t=1772735373\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805260/extras/20f0f628b1f7624ae0964b1638118182.webm?t=1772735373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805260/extras/20f0f628b1f7624ae0964b1638118182.mp4?t=1772735373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Speedrun the levels and compete with yourself and the global leaderboard to prove that you are the number one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805260/extras/14c7c48cbe458c8411bf065c6d838169.poster.avif?t=1772735373\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805260/extras/14c7c48cbe458c8411bf065c6d838169.webm?t=1772735373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805260/extras/14c7c48cbe458c8411bf065c6d838169.mp4?t=1772735373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Different polyhedrons have different effects, shoot them and master their effects to get better ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805260/extras/eb63b24e2514ec2bceb53acf33c7d4a4.poster.avif?t=1772735373\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805260/extras/eb63b24e2514ec2bceb53acf33c7d4a4.webm?t=1772735373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805260/extras/eb63b24e2514ec2bceb53acf33c7d4a4.mp4?t=1772735373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2805260?t=1772735373","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2805260?t=1772735373","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805260/b9e3b2e28a35ca56d01c9706368194dd480507a6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772735373","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805260/b9e3b2e28a35ca56d01c9706368194dd480507a6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772735373","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2811660,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>POLY IMPULSE</strong> is a minimalist fast-paced movement FPS where you will have to shoot colorful polyhedrons to impulse yourself through the level. Accuracy is also very importa